<section id="fe-friction" aria-labelledby="day-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="fit">
      <div class="hero">
        <h2 id="day-title">Think your operations are under control?</h2>
        <p class="lead">Take a closer look at what you're missing.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="swipe">Swipe to follow the day →</p>
      <div class="board">
        <div class="grid head">
          <div></div>
          <div class="times">
            <div><b>9:00</b><small>Who signed in?</small></div>
            <div><b>11:00</b><small>AC breaks down</small></div>
            <div><b>2:00</b><small>AMC renewal</small></div>
            <div><b>4:00</b><small>Audit request</small></div>
            <div><b>6:00</b><small>“How are we doing?”</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid row red">
          <div class="lbl"><h3>Still running manually</h3><p>Registers, sheets, WhatsApp</p></div>
          <div>
            <div class="track"><div class="rail"></div><div class="streak"></div>
              <div class="stops"><div class="stop">!</div><div class="stop">!</div><div class="stop">!</div><div class="stop">!</div><div class="stop">!</div></div></div>
            <div class="notes"><div>Check the register.</div><div>Now find out who handles it ?</div><div>Someone should have remembered.</div><div>Time to dig through files.</div><div>“Let me get back to you.”</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid row amber">
          <div class="lbl"><h3>Using disconnected tools</h3><p>A tool per job, none talking</p></div>
          <div>
            <div class="track"><div class="rail"></div><div class="streak"></div>
              <div class="stops"><div class="stop">⇄</div><div class="stop">⇄</div><div class="stop">⇄</div><div class="stop">⇄</div><div class="stop">⇄</div></div></div>
            <div class="notes"><div>Visitor app knows. Access system doesn’t.</div><div>Ticket raised. Asset history is elsewhere.</div><div>Another reminder buried in another tracker.</div><div>Data scattered across tools.</div><div>Three dashboards that don’t agree.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid row green">
          <div class="lbl"><h3>Running on FusionEdge</h3><p>One platform, one source of truth</p></div>
          <div>
            <div class="track"><div class="rail"></div><div class="streak"></div>
              <div class="stops"><div class="stop">✓</div><div class="stop">✓</div><div class="stop">✓</div><div class="stop">✓</div><div class="stop">✓</div></div></div>
            <div class="notes"><div>Visitors, desks and access. One live view.</div><div>Ticket logged. Asset history attached.</div><div>Flagged 30 days ahead, PO ready.</div><div>One click. Complete audit trail.</div><div>One live dashboard. One clear answer.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="cta r" href="#touch-title"><small>Manual</small><b>Registers, calls and endless follow-ups.<br>Delayed at every step.</b></a>
        <a class="cta a" href="#touch-title"><small>Disconnected</small><b>Digital tools, disconnected information.<br>Always connecting the dots.</b></a>
        <a class="cta g" href="#touch-title"><small>FusionEdge</small><b>Connected workflows. One live view.<br>In control. Every step.</b></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  #fe-friction{
    --bg:#ffffff; --ink:#14111a; --muted:#6b6577; --line:#ece9f1; --card:#faf9fc;
    --red:#e5484d; --red-soft:#fdecec; --amber:#f0a92e; --amber-soft:#fdf3e1;
    --green:#1fb57f; --green-soft:#dff7ee; --green-bright:#3ddc9e;
    font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
    padding:0 5vw;margin:0;box-sizing:border-box;
  }
  #fe-friction *{box-sizing:border-box}
  #fe-friction .wrap{max-width:none;width:100%;margin:0 auto}
  #fe-friction .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:0;margin:18px 0 40px;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:0}
  #fe-friction .hero h2{margin:0;padding:clamp(32px,5vh,64px) 0 0;max-width:none;width:100%;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:600;font-size:calc(var(--type-h) - 1px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#1a1424}
  #fe-friction .hero .lead{margin:6px auto 0;max-width:640px;text-align:center;font-family:"Public Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:var(--type-body);line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:normal;color:#1a1424}
  #fe-friction .board{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:28px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(20,17,26,.05)}
